Findings and fixes:
  * the two failing assertions exposed real behavior: the engine emitted cost
    payment (ManaTapped) before the Cast event, and the test fixture created a
    state (cleanup with no priority) that cannot be reached in play. The engine
    was changed to announce the spell on the stack (CR 601.2a) before paying
    costs (601.2h); the untap test was rewritten to reach turn 2 through the real
    scheduler.

